3c. Replay recorded cases against the built Mojo port

Usage: mojo-anything diff [OPTIONS] [CRATE_DIR]

Arguments:
  [CRATE_DIR]
          [default: .]

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Target: this machine

          Possible values:
          - host: This machine
          
          [default: host]

      --module <MODULE>
          Test this JS module instead of the crate's `index.cjs`

      --ignore-key-order
          Compare objects regardless of key order

      --float-tolerance <FLOAT_TOLERANCE>
          Floats match within this tolerance for this run (the one saved by `record` otherwise)

      --json
          

      --node-arg <NODE_ARGS>
          

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
